  <SubComponents>
    <Component class="javax.swing.JLabel" name="jLabel2">
      <Properties>
        <Property name="font" type="java.awt.Font" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.FontEditor">
          <Font name="Segoe UI" size="14" style="1"/>
        </Property>
        <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="NET PLOT AREA AND COMPUTATION OF FSI"/>
      </Properties>
    </Component>
    <Container class="javax.swing.JScrollPane" name="jScrollPane2">
      <Properties>
        <Property name="horizontalScrollBarPolicy" type="int" value="31"/>
        <Property name="verticalScrollBarPolicy" type="int" value="21"/>
      </Properties>
      <AuxValues>
        <AuxValue name="autoScrollPane" type="java.lang.Boolean" value="true"/>
      </AuxValues>

      <Layout class="org.netbeans.modules.form.compat2.layouts.support.JScrollPaneSupportLayout"/>
      <SubComponents>
        <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="jTextArea1">
          <Properties>
            <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
              <Color blue="f2" green="f2" red="f2" type="rgb"/>
            </Property>
            <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="i) In case of a plotted layout / sub-division / group housing scheme / any development, net area shall be the balance  &#xa;plot area after  deducting the area covered by amenity space under Regulation No.3.5 and Development / Regional Plan &#xa;proposals including new roads and road widening, if any, from the total area of plot. &#xa;ii) For the purpose of computation of FSI / built-up area, the net area of the plot shall only be considered.  &#xa;iii) In case of plotted layout, the basic FSI of such net area shall be distributed on all plots on pro-rata basis or on certain&#xa;plots as land owner desires, subject to maximum receiving potential prescribed in these regulations. &#xa;However, such entitlement of FSI on certain plots shall be clearly mentioned on the layout plan.  &#xa;iv) In case of plots from already approved layouts, the plot area shall be treated as net plot area. &#xa;v) The above regulations in respect of net plot area and computation of FSI shall apply to proposals in all land use zones."/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
      </SubComponents>
    </Container>
    <Component class="javax.swing.JLabel" name="jLabel3">
      <Properties>
        <Property name="font" type="java.awt.Font" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.FontEditor">
          <Font name="Segoe UI" size="14" style="1"/>
        </Property>
        <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="TRANSFER OF LAND UNDER D.P. SITES (OTHER THAN D.P. ROAD) IN LIEU OF FSI "/>
      </Properties>
    </Component>
    <Container class="javax.swing.JScrollPane" name="jScrollPane3">
      <Properties>
        <Property name="horizontalScrollBarPolicy" type="int" value="31"/>
        <Property name="verticalScrollBarPolicy" type="int" value="21"/>
      </Properties>
      <AuxValues>
        <AuxValue name="autoScrollPane" type="java.lang.Boolean" value="true"/>
      </AuxValues>

      <Layout class="org.netbeans.modules.form.compat2.layouts.support.JScrollPaneSupportLayout"/>
      <SubComponents>
        <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="jTextArea2">
          <Properties>
            <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
              <Color blue="f2" green="f2" red="f2" type="rgb"/>
            </Property>
            <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="i) If an owner hands over a reserved site to the Authority free of cost, they can use its FSI on the remaining land, equivalent &#xa;to TDR.&#xa;ii) A transfer deed must be executed, and FSI details included in the development proposal.&#xa;iii) In plotted layouts, FSI can be distributed as per owner&#x2019;s choice, within the maximum permissible limit based on road &#xa;width (Regulation 6.3).&#xa;iv) The receiving plot must have a minimum 9m road frontage.&#xa;v) Unused FSI can be claimed as TDR.&#xa;vi) If FSI is utilized on-site, DRC procedure is not required."/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
      </SubComponents>
    </Container>
    <Component class="javax.swing.JLabel" name="jLabel4">
      <Properties>
        <Property name="font" type="java.awt.Font" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.FontEditor">
          <Font name="Segoe UI" size="14" style="1"/>
        </Property>
        <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="RELOCATION OF D.P. / R.P. SITES / ROADS"/>
      </Properties>
    </Component>
    <Container class="javax.swing.JScrollPane" name="jScrollPane4">
      <Properties>
        <Property name="horizontalScrollBarPolicy" type="int" value="31"/>
        <Property name="verticalScrollBarPolicy" type="int" value="21"/>
      </Properties>
      <AuxValues>
        <AuxValue name="autoScrollPane" type="java.lang.Boolean" value="true"/>
      </AuxValues>

      <Layout class="org.netbeans.modules.form.compat2.layouts.support.JScrollPaneSupportLayout"/>
      <SubComponents>
        <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="jTextArea3">
          <Properties>
            <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
              <Color blue="f2" green="f2" red="f2" type="rgb"/>
            </Property>
            <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="A) Shifting of reservations is allowed without altering the reserved area but not permitted if:&#xa;&#x9;i) It is split into multiple parts.&#xa;&#x9;ii) It moves beyond 500m from its original location.&#xa;&#x9;iii) It moves outside the owner&#x2019;s holding.&#xa;&#x9;iv) The new location differs significantly in access, levels, or size.&#xa;&#x9;v) It has already been relocated under these regulations.&#xa;&#x9;vi) It involves geo-sensitive land (e.g., biodiversity zones, nallahs).&#xa;&#x9;vii) It is outside the sanctioned layout area.&#xa;&#xa;B) Approval Process:&#xa;&#x9;i) Authority handles the relocation and reports it to the Government &amp; Town Planning Director.&#xa;&#x9;ii) The Development Plan is deemed modified upon approval.&#xa;&#xa;C) Relocation to Another Owner&#x2019;s Land:&#xa;&#x9;i) Allowed within 300m if the other owner consents via a registered deed and hands over land in &#xa;&#x9;exchange for TDR.&#xa;&#x9;ii) Restrictions of sub-regulations (d), (e), and (f) apply.&#xa;&#x9;iii) No layout submission is required from the consenting owner.&#xa;&#xa;D) Road Alignment Shifts:&#xa;&#x9;i) Allowed if inlet &amp; outlet points remain unchanged and traffic flow is unaffected.&#xa;&#x9;ii) Must be approved by the Divisional Joint Director of Town Planning for smaller municipalities and &#xa;&#x9;regional areas.&#xa;&#x9;iii) The Development/Regional Plan is deemed modified accordingly."/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
      </SubComponents>
    </Container>
    <Component class="javax.swing.JLabel" name="jLabel5">
      <Properties>
        <Property name="font" type="java.awt.Font" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.FontEditor">
          <Font name="Segoe UI" size="14" style="1"/>
        </Property>
        <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="AMALGAMATION OF PLOTS"/>
      </Properties>
    </Component>
    <Container class="javax.swing.JScrollPane" name="jScrollPane5">
      <Properties>
        <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
          <Color blue="f2" green="f2" red="f2" type="rgb"/>
        </Property>
        <Property name="horizontalScrollBarPolicy" type="int" value="31"/>
        <Property name="verticalScrollBarPolicy" type="int" value="21"/>
      </Properties>
      <AuxValues>
        <AuxValue name="autoScrollPane" type="java.lang.Boolean" value="true"/>
      </AuxValues>

      <Layout class="org.netbeans.modules.form.compat2.layouts.support.JScrollPaneSupportLayout"/>
      <SubComponents>
        <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="jTextArea4">
          <Properties>
            <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
              <Color blue="f2" green="f2" red="f2" type="rgb"/>
            </Property>
            <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="i) Amalgamation of plots / lands shall be permissible if they form a sizable plot from planning point of &#xa;view and are contiguous. &#xa;ii) Amenity and layout plot shall also be entitled for amalgamation provided amenity is developed on proportionate area.&#xa;iii) Land separated by minor water course or nallah or road may be entitled for amalgamation provided connecting &#xa;over bridge or under pass of sufficient width and strength is constructed by the owner with the approval of&#xa0;the&#xa0;Authority."/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
      </SubComponents>
    </Container>
  </SubComponents>
</Form>
